OL,3,CNear 2,900 heat-related deaths
OL,4,Crecorded in May and June, figures show
OL,6,FAround 2,877 heat-related deaths were
OL,7,Frecorded during the hot weather in May
OL,8,Fand June this year, according to the
OL,9,FUK Health Security Agency (UKHSA).
OL,11,FThe UKHSA also warned that 2026 could
OL,12,Fsee the highest number of heat-
OL,13,Fassociated deaths on record,
OL,14,Fsurpassing figures recorded since it
OL,15,Fbegan monitoring them in 2022.
OL,17,FAn estimated 753 deaths were linked to
OL,18,Fthe heatwave between 24 and 27 May,
OL,19,Fwith a further 2,124 deaths associated
OL,20,Fwith the heatwave from 21 to 28 June.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
