OL,3,CNear 2,900 heat-related deaths
OL,4,Crecorded in May and June, figures show
OL,6,FThe total of 2,877 deaths is almost
OL,7,Fdouble the 1,504 recorded during UK
OL,8,Fheatwaves between June and August last
OL,9,Fyear.
OL,11,F"While these figures remain interim,
OL,12,Fthey are already approaching the
OL,13,Fannual record reported by UKHSA in
OL,14,F2022," the agency said in its report.
OL,16,FIn 2022, the UK recorded 2,985 heat-
OL,17,Fassociated deaths across five
OL,18,Fheatwaves, after temperatures reached
OL,19,Fa record 40.3C in Coningsby,
OL,20,FLincolnshire, on 19 July.
