OL,3,CNear 2,900 heat-related deaths
OL,4,Crecorded in May and June, figures show
OL,6,FThis year, both May and June broke UK
OL,7,Ftemperature records, with highs of
OL,8,F31.5C recorded at Kew Gardens on 26
OL,9,FMay and 38.0C recorded at Lingwood,
OL,10,FNorfolk, on 26 June.
OL,12,FThe figures come as temperatures
OL,13,Fclimbed into the 30s in parts of the
OL,14,FUK on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThe UKHSA issued an amber heat-health
OL,17,Falert for the East Midlands, East of
OL,18,FEngland, South East and London.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
