OL,3,CNear 2,900 heat-related deaths
OL,4,Crecorded in May and June, figures show
OL,6,FThe alert remained in place until 9am
OL,7,Fon Thursday, after the agency warned
OL,8,Fthat rising temperatures could
OL,9,Fincrease health risks, particularly
OL,10,Ffor vulnerable groups.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FHowever, the Met Office said cooler
OL,18,Fconditions were on the way, with
OL,19,Ftemperatures expected to return closer
OL,20,Fto average across much of the UK.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
