OL,3,CNear 2,900 heat-related deaths
OL,4,Crecorded in May and June, figures show
OL,6,FElsewhere, properties were evacuated
OL,7,Fas firefighters battled a major
OL,8,Fheathland blaze on the Suffolk coast
OL,9,Fduring the UK's fourth heatwave of the
OL,10,Fsummer.
OL,12,FA major incident was declared after
OL,13,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue Service
OL,14,Fresponded to reports of a wildfire at
OL,15,FDunwich Heath, near Leiston, shortly
OL,16,Fafter 5.30pm on Wednesday.
